OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on new SEND school
OL,4,
OL,5,FWork has started on a new school for
OL,6,Fchildren with special educational needs
OL,7,Fand disabilities in Hull, the city
OL,8,Fcouncil said.
OL,10,FWillowfield Academy will cater for 125
OL,11,Fpupils with severe physical and/or
OL,12,Flearning difficulties and create up to
OL,13,F100 full time jobs.
OL,15,FHull City Council said the building's
OL,16,Flow-carbon design will include a
OL,17,Fmixture of teaching and therapy spaces
OL,18,Fand a hydrotherapy pool.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
