OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on new SEND school
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe authority said the new school would
OL,6,Fallow more children from Hull with
OL,7,Fspecialist needs to receive an
OL,8,Feducation closer to home, with reduced
OL,9,Ftravelling time, better outcomes and
OL,10,Freduced costs.
